    "detailed_description": "Raid a gazillion handcrafted dungeons, collect loot and creature cards and build your own dungeons for others!<br><br>MONOLISK is a fantasy ARPG, CCG and dungeon builder in a single package. Build dungeons, share them with your followers, gear up your heroes and clear levels built by your friends! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1454520/extras/3c50bc14d0e354340752cc743ba6ed5f.avif?t=1726252404\" /></div><br><br>* Clear heaps of dungeons in an online hack 'n' slash RPG<br>* Collect cards with equipment, abilities, creatures and environments<br>* Customize your 5 heroes with various playstyles<br>* Design unique levels for your friends and followers<br>* Craft new cards and expand your collection<br>* Tell your own stories<br>* Help others rebuild the shattered world of MONOLISK!",
    "about_the_game": "Raid a gazillion handcrafted dungeons, collect loot and creature cards and build your own dungeons for others!<br><br>MONOLISK is a fantasy ARPG, CCG and dungeon builder in a single package. Build dungeons, share them with your followers, gear up your heroes and clear levels built by your friends! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1454520/extras/3c50bc14d0e354340752cc743ba6ed5f.avif?t=1726252404\" /></div><br><br>* Clear heaps of dungeons in an online hack 'n' slash RPG<br>* Collect cards with equipment, abilities, creatures and environments<br>* Customize your 5 heroes with various playstyles<br>* Design unique levels for your friends and followers<br>* Craft new cards and expand your collection<br>* Tell your own stories<br>* Help others rebuild the shattered world of MONOLISK!",
    "short_description": "Raid a gazillion handcrafted dungeons, collect loot and creature cards and build your own dungeons for others! MONOLISK is a fantasy ARPG, CCG and dungeon builder in a single package. Build dungeons, share them with your followers, gear up your heroes and clear levels built by your friends!",
